dkit writedb: Process raw data into datakit files

USAGE

    $ dkit writedb [MODNAMES] [OPTIONS]

ARGUMENTS

    MODNAMES: Name(s) of modules to process, e.g. db0001

OPTIONS

    -h, --help
        Print this help message and exit

    --force, -f
        Overwrite any existing database files (only for MODNAMES)

    --force-all, -F, --force_all
        Overwrite all database files including added dependencies

    --prefix PREFIX
        Specify prefix which may be left off of MODNAMES

    --no-reqs, --dependencies, --requirements
        Don't read requirements; just process MODNAMES {True}

    --no-write
        Don't actually write databases (just print dependencies) {True}

    --write_func, --func, --write-func FUNC
        Function name in modules to process datakit files
